    {
      "uid": "zhcn:889efd07ac75cea08e0635e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……一看就知道了吧？\n我的头发……那个，有一点容易膨胀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfb445ac703f36d8db9272f13ea2d9528cd90f3647f10210ba1f3b862775f47e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
