      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯？……虽然不是很懂，但我没事哦。\n好啦，经过10分钟咯。继续训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e80ee34a053633988ea9474f6837756d9dad9ffdc466f2cafe1eab62f237041d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
