      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……好，今天的训练课表全部达成了。\n跟预定时刻一样，拿捏得正好。嗯，很完美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7222d3696284b26f3c8f148af92cc83e3a94fe3ced645724216d3dccf2e8a4c4",
