    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae7d5e0945ea9b32f3372444",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但刚才的问题就跟字面一样，是询问你今晚的行程。\n如果没什么事的话，希望你陪我去一个地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0c712c322d5c8556c1d41be47030e534a2130078239ec8141792f1d4fafd1ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d05b8037416e8133f32102c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b8fa7e9d29e8512dcd4f68f1ba91cc31eef66c9e56adf5ae07aa10a7856d013",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:541e2d4d02fd9071296dc2fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对。仔细一想，我发现从这次集训开始后，\n除了协调训练内容外，都没有跟你交谈过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f5c49afd41598babd0c7fa86d6bc335a198f8a85f50e06fdfc4a4692591ec8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbe901033fdaa495ec285abe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b8fa7e9d29e8512dcd4f68f1ba91cc31eef66c9e56adf5ae07aa10a7856d013",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c75ff9cdeaf713ea75395a6d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然有点早，但我想跟你聊聊，也算是回顾这次集训。\n……啊，不对。要是包含回顾，定义会偏掉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "652166962eea0890b3905a338b2e60c05000f83d5310883f54f1016cb5686296",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:150654bced8ec9782a3a8f80",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训开始了，琵琶晨光以提升基础能力为目标，\n在海滩上努力训练体干。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76d852afcf56f8b7255a0a6ae354dceeee451ee2f82d40481f1e54e6da209781",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b01bf71ed502a3d5e9896463",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b8fa7e9d29e8512dcd4f68f1ba91cc31eef66c9e56adf5ae07aa10a7856d013",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:245497c29647f2f8321d5df3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "总之，我现在想告诉你的是……\n──我想跟你一起去逛祭典。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c173f2075e3ee7480811f89c848e0f5afa49f2a88308313dbad47cbae984273b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bacfc557a1dccd40f71fb4a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（咚咚咚咚……啪哩！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cda3404657590569930a64b17bee48317b9f86e2c760ac920ace713cfd23f38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
