    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cbb9819a189e66020aab5d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f671d58ce0da3c97f7e2298c552ed49c4cc9df3b3f957fb7c6415ec7e0b83920",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e05cf7270459332e6c3f0705",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摊贩大叔",
      "source_fingerprint": "da780e764b236f361d08c46662f6168d4b938dbdc5c0bde2b5bb0c58832e7dca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b2a09e1c043b4e1ae9cf912",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊～这样不行啊。鱼的尾巴都粉碎了，真可惜！\n欢迎再来挑战啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2872dfa30fb0806548e584f485b449cd394a0ed671fde1e75b5e5f4e7c3c33a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a94dd2cd7bfb7fb2ceab5048",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b8fa7e9d29e8512dcd4f68f1ba91cc31eef66c9e56adf5ae07aa10a7856d013",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b5c59c9bdcc9c1072b1b08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可恶……又失败了吗？理论上只要注意\n凹槽部分的强弱，应该就能顺利完成才对……",
      "source_fingerprint": "eebe408f1455320f0b36d285156b9890262ca16f11f1446a9b58296cfd0e82b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4476c11fc84d4f3d2cdedae1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光带我来到\n在集训宿舍附近举办的夏日祭典。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3714388868ccf7c6158aa6094d055e9d0f3ebb3ffb87f37cfe8c3a5df22264c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a93bcc12e3795166c081c3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们悠闲地逛了一阵子后，\n两人一起挑战“挑糖型”，不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcccb3f01a4e593ff5c608586dfa54a096ac518b23acc3a85515357a836f7090",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fed6deb7d4978015386facb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许是太过紧绷了",
      "source_fingerprint": "85bb3b998711569fba4a6984dcb23ea096c0a9bb75b308f72dc1416161d390e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9603c79f51bba2904c610214",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b8fa7e9d29e8512dcd4f68f1ba91cc31eef66c9e56adf5ae07aa10a7856d013",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f63a90937702fb81e19d047",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "使用的牙签重新削过了。粉尘防范也很完美。\n既然如此……果然是力道没有调整好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "97bce8656a7ee7811da7897a39bbfeff86d998c4aa494e07133b8d6e121b2709",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1d24b6e6cb87227a9cb8154",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b8fa7e9d29e8512dcd4f68f1ba91cc31eef66c9e56adf5ae07aa10a7856d013",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d45737c5c87ff4efe6134ed8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯……似乎是那样呢。因为理论完美无缺，\n却无法顺利进行的话，我好像就会着急而过于激动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f715b13e861c267ee2d11af37fa8ff4118790422a1f0a3a814d341a5a6130cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b95edd080b0e0e2e6191292",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b8fa7e9d29e8512dcd4f68f1ba91cc31eef66c9e56adf5ae07aa10a7856d013",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:458fd0b633b22328eb3511d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……到头来，无论建构出多么完美的方程式，\n要是自身的力量无法追上，也不过是数字的排列组合罢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff1de73c57d5af9c7b05c126d8191b7b1127ce04a9b24eada6ef89c0312aa91e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:373939043cd92bbd853e3542",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了今后能有稳定的成绩，这是我们两人一起拟定的\n完美训练计划。但到了集训尾声时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6ae8a99abfb1b9467ff3724f87a8bed69d3903d5ac62e92634fa37caffe9c67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b598c89976838638c2849d5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b8fa7e9d29e8512dcd4f68f1ba91cc31eef66c9e56adf5ae07aa10a7856d013",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b072092dfa35e7bf0c61ea3c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果是天生资质聪颖且会不断钻研的人……例如我妹妹，\n应该也能用最快的速度证明那个方程式吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cbf7988096ec4bb4374d735a4ef5faa1fabd3d74ece5bc6f3e89cb213c4c8a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5327b4593326b1d5f657b14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光的视线忽然往上抬。我跟着她仰望天空，\n只见天上有耀眼的星星，也有必须仔细看才会发现的小星星。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eef97ab210527e4380a6e116c843d23db927ae530f9bd7311c98da0df33fb37",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
