      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但我不一样。我必须测量最短距离、排除障碍物、\n调整好奔跑的环境……才勉强能站上起跑线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "105f3dd37295d8b352c972cec612798ad99a7e370834bd3d936039c36c0c2b3a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
