      "uid": "zhcn:911b6a8172fcfe5a1d79ba4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我这个人没有特别优秀，所以只能挣扎。\n然后找到理论这个武器，加以锻炼之后变成现在的我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d67bdb09fbdece0a520d86b123d37c1d01adebaa20dc4bc8254da532170f1c3",
